# Claude Code plugin settings — machine-specific.
# .claude-plugin/marketplace.json IS tracked: it is portable and is this
# repo's own distribution surface. This file is not — it carries the
# absolute path of one checkout, so committing it would point every other
# clone at a directory that does not exist for them.
